# Realm of Spirits — Change Tracking

When modifying the Roblox project RealmOfSpirits (via MCP or docs):

1. After any gameplay/code change in Studio, update `docs/realm-of-spirits/CHANGELOG.md` under `[Unreleased]`:
   - Added — new features, scripts, systems
   - Changed — balance, refactors, behavior changes
   - Fixed — bug fixes
   - Removed — deleted features/assets

2. If architecture or systems change significantly, update `docs/realm-of-spirits/PROJECT.md`.

3. If game design changes (mechanics, progression, content), update `docs/realm-of-spirits/GDD.md`.

4. Entry format:
   ```
   ### Category
   - Brief description (script/path if relevant)
   ```

5. On release milestone, move `[Unreleased]` items to a new version section with date.

